# views/open.view: the S7 `Open(viewer, id)` view, v1 (S7.L5's fix: one answer for "missing" and "denied").
# The course supplies it in the view format the checker's encoder reads (checker/src/lib.rs):
#
#   view <name>
#   missing <code>     what a request for a document that does not exist returns
#   denied <code>      what a request for a document the viewer may not read returns
#   field <name>       a field the page returns: title, body or internal_notes, one line each
#   total <how>        the count the response carries: none, visible (matches the viewer may read) or
#                      all (every match, counted before the filter)
#
# LAB-7.5 asks you to make the roadmap's deliberate bug on purpose (TODO(you)): the shared page also returns
# internal_notes. Remove the # in front of the last line, then run `statespace check lab7.5`.
# LAB-7.7 keeps the leaky view in broken/ and the cure in fixed/.
view open
missing not_found
denied not_found
field title
field body
total none
# field internal_notes
